<title>USA: Ahmanson says FTC to end wait period early.</title>
<headline>Ahmanson says FTC to end wait period early.</headline>
<dateline>IRWINDALE, Calif. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.F. Ahmanson said Friday it has been granted early termination of the Hart-Scott-Rodino waiting period applicable to its stated intention to purchase in excess of $15 million of comon shares of Great Western Financial Corp effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company said the action by the Federal Trade Commission enhances its flexibility to move forward on its merger proposal with Great Western.</p>
</text>
